**/android/.gradle/
**/android/captures/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/**/build/
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/app/profile/
**/android/app/release/
**/*.apk
**/*.aab

# Keystores & Signing
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# iOS & macOS Platform Artifacts
