**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Pods/
**/macos/Pods/
**/.symlinks/
**/profile
**/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/DerivedData/
**/*.moved-aside
**/*.ipa
**/*.xcuserstate

# CocoaPods
Pods/
**/Pods/

